  "content": "<!-- ====== HERO — Background image with left-aligned title ====== -->\n  <section class=\"hero hero--image\" style=\"background-image: url('https://plastic-craft.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_04.jpg');\">\n\n    <div class=\"hero__content\">\n      <p class=\"hero__label\">Industry Solutions</p>\n      <h1 class=\"hero__title\">Boats, Docks &amp; Marinas</h1>\n      <hr class=\"hero__divider\">\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== INTRO TEXT ====== -->\n  <section class=\"intro intro--tight\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"intro__content\">\n        <p>Owning a boat has many advantages, but when a part breaks or goes missing sometimes the hardest part can be finding a replacement.</p>\n        <p>Plastic-Craft Products can supply you with a wide range of products in sheets, rods, and tubing. We are also custom fabricators, so let our CNC routers and fabrication equipment provide you with high-quality components and replacement parts for all your boating needs.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== APPLICATIONS (Image + Tabbed Lists) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"applications\" id=\"applications\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"applications__layout\">\n\n        <!-- Featured Image -->\n        <div class=\"applications__image\">\n          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Replace src with your own image -->\n          <img src=\"\" alt=\"Boats, docks, and marina plastics\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#d0e9fd;min-height:480px;\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tabbed Application Lists -->\n        <div class=\"applications__body\">\n          <h2>Our Applications</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"applications__tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n            <button class=\"applications__tab active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-hull\" id=\"tab-hull\">Hull &amp; Deck</button>\n            <button class=\"applications__tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-mechanical\" id=\"tab-mechanical\">Mechanical &amp; Electrical</button>\n            <button class=\"applications__tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-dock\" id=\"tab-dock\">Dock &amp; Accessories</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel: Hull & Deck -->\n          <div class=\"applications__panel active\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-hull\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-hull\">\n            <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n              <li>Cowls</li>\n              <li>Fairings</li>\n              <li>Swim Platforms</li>\n              <li>Decking</li>\n              <li>Gangways and Steps</li>\n              <li>Grab Rails and Handles</li>\n              <li>Windows</li>\n              <li>Cabinetry</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel: Mechanical & Electrical -->\n          <div class=\"applications__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-mechanical\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-mechanical\">\n            <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n              <li>Fuel Lines</li>\n              <li>Rudder and Stern Shaft Bearings</li>\n              <li>Deck Machinery Bushings and Linear Bearings</li>\n              <li>Pump Bearings</li>\n              <li>Pulleys and Sheaves</li>\n              <li>Switch Board Panels</li>\n              <li>Relay Bases</li>\n              <li>Sealing</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Panel: Dock & Accessories -->\n          <div class=\"applications__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-dock\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-dock\">\n            <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n              <li>Fishing Rod Holders and Racks</li>\n              <li>Bait Tanks</li>\n              <li>Boat and Dock Bumpers</li>\n              <li>Custom Cutting Boards</li>\n              <li>Plastic Restoration</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== MATERIALS (Banner bar + Tag Grid) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"materials\" id=\"materials\">\n    <div class=\"materials__banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>Our Materials</h2>\n        <p>UV and saltwater resistant plastics engineered for the marine environment</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"materials__grid\">\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Acrylic (PMMA)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">ABS</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Nylon (PA)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Phenolic</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polycarbonate (PC)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyethylene Terephthalate (PET)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyurethane (PU/PUR)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">Polyvinyl Chloride (PVC)</span>\n      <span class=\"material-tag\">UHMW Polyethylene</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== ADVANTAGES (Card Carousel) ====== -->\n  <section class=\"advantages\" id=\"advantages\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"advantages__header\">\n        <h2>Advantages of Using Plastic-Craft</h2>\n        <p>Purpose-built plastics that endure the harshest marine conditions</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"advantages__carousel\">\n        <button class=\"advantages__arrow advantages__arrow--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">&larr;</button>\n        <button class=\"advantages__arrow advantages__arrow--next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">&rarr;</button>\n\n        <div class=\"advantages__track\" id=\"advantagesTrack\">\n\n          <!-- Card 1 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Stable &amp; Rigid</h3>\n            <p>Superior flatness that doesn&rsquo;t warp or delaminate, even in extreme marine conditions.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 2 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"/><line x1=\"4.22\" y1=\"4.22\" x2=\"5.64\" y2=\"5.64\"/><line x1=\"18.36\" y1=\"18.36\" x2=\"19.78\" y2=\"19.78\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"3\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"4.22\" y1=\"19.78\" x2=\"5.64\" y2=\"18.36\"/><line x1=\"18.36\" y1=\"5.64\" x2=\"19.78\" y2=\"4.22\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>UV &amp; Weather Resistant</h3>\n            <p>Saltwater, UV, weather, chemical, odor, and stain resistant for lasting performance outdoors.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 3 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Lightweight &amp; Easy to Clean</h3>\n            <p>Lightweight construction that cleans easily with no painting required.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 4 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Moisture Resistant</h3>\n            <p>Low-moisture absorption &mdash; does not rot, swell, or splinter like traditional wood materials.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 5 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5L12 2z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Sculpted Contours</h3>\n            <p>Complex, sculpted contours with increased hydrodynamics for streamlined marine designs.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 6 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Excellent Wear Performance</h3>\n            <p>Excellent bearing and wear performance with low coefficient of thermal expansion.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 7 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M18.36 6.64a9 9 0 1 1-12.73 0\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Non-Conductive &amp; Flexible</h3>\n            <p>Non-conductive and flexible materials ideal for electrical panels and harsh marine applications.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Card 8 -->\n          <div class=\"advantage-card\">\n            <div class=\"advantage-card__icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Available in Many Colors</h3>\n            <p>Wide selection of colors to match any vessel design or marina aesthetic.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Carousel Dots -->\n      <div class=\"advantages__dots\" id=\"advantagesDots\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ====== CTA / CONTACT ====== -->\n  <section class=\"cta-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>\n      <p>Our specialist team is ready to supply custom-fabricated components and replacement parts for all your boating and marine needs.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-section__actions\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--primary\">Request a Quote</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--outline\">Contact Our Team</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
  "excerpt": "Plastic-Craft supplies UV and saltwater resistant plastics for boats, docks, marinas, and nautical equipment — custom fabricated components and replacement parts.",
